OL,3,AHundreds of flights cancelled as severe
OL,4,Aweather disrupts Thanksgiving travel in
OL,5,AUS
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than 350 flights in the US have
OL,8,Fbeen cancelled so far on Thursday as
OL,9,Fbad weather coincides with busy travel
OL,10,Fon the Thanksgiving holiday.
OL,12,FAnother 700 flights into, out of, or
OL,13,Fwithin the US have been delayed,
OL,14,Ftracking site FlightAware said.
OL,16,FOn Wednesday, the Federal Aviation
OL,17,FAdministration (FAA) briefly grounded
OL,18,Fall flights heading for Miami
OL,19,FInternational Airport after a FedEx
OL,20,Faircraft overran a runway. No injuries
OL,21,Fwere reported, and the FAA is
OL,22,Finvestigating.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
