OL,3,AHundreds of flights cancelled as severe
OL,4,Aweather disrupts Thanksgiving travel in
OL,5,AUS
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than 80 million Americans were
OL,8,Fexpected to be traveling this week at
OL,9,Fthe same time the National Weather
OL,10,FService (NWS) has forecast storms along
OL,11,Fthe western and eastern coasts of the
OL,12,FUS that could bring heavy rain and
OL,13,Fflooding.
